Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Scratch half the foil, and the rest clears itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.37,0:00:07.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Underneath sits your message, like a tip or a discount code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Thumbs scratch it on a phone, and a mouse works on a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:14.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,Can't drag? One tap on Reveal without scratching opens it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:19.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,The code is free in the Website Lab at vaelolab.com/lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:22.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send this to the shop owner writing a Black Friday code tonight!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.37,Hook,,0,0,0,,Scratch half.\N{\c&H69D2EB&}It opens.
